SUMMARY:SpongeBob the Musical
DESCRIPTION:Dive into this irresistible musical adventure\, where an unexpected hero\, and the power of friendship & community\, save the day! It’s fun for the whole family! Showtimes vary between 2pm & 7pm. See the event hosts’ website for details. \nBased on the series by Stephen Hillenburg\nBook by Kyle Jarrow\nMusical Production Conceived by Tina Landau\nOriginal Songs by Yolanda Adams\, Steven Tyler & Joe Perry of Aerosmith\, Sara Bareilles\, Jonathan Coulton\, Alex Ebert of Edward Sharpe & the Magnetic Zeros\, The Flaming Lips\, Lady A\, Cyndi Lauper\, John Legend\, Panic! At the Disco\, Plain White T’s\, They Might Be Giants\, T.I.\nAnd Songs by David Bowie\, Tom Kenny & Andy Paley Additional Lyrics by Jonathan Coulton | Additional Music by Tom Kitt\nDirected by Brian Weaver Music Direction by Eric Nordin Choreography by Kemba Shannon \nAll seating is General Admission. \nPay-What-You-Wish Wednesdays! The PWYW Wednesday performance for SpongeBob Squarepants: the Broadway Musical will be Wednesday\, May 7th. These tickets start at $5.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/spongebob-the-musical/2026-05-17/
LOCATION:Portland Playhouse\, 602 NE Prescott St.\, Portland\, OR\, 97211
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Music,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/spongebob-musical.jpg
END:VEVENT
