DESCRIPTION:Family owned and operated peony grower selling fresh cut peony stems and plants.  Clip your own bouquet or we will cut your selection for you.  Come stroll our two acres of peonies and enjoy the view of farmland around us! \nIf you prefer an order ready to go\, give us a call. We have 47 different varieties ranging from early to late season. \n2026 Season Hours: \nMay 3 – June3\nM-F 10a-5:30p\nS/S 10a-4p \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
